   ```cpp
   MPI_Finalize();
   ```

### Example Code

Here is a complete example of how to access the MPI rank and size in an IPPL-based application:

```cpp
// Include necessary headers
#include <mpi.h>
#include <iostream>

int main(int argc, char** argv) {
    // Initialize MPI
    int rank, size;
    MPI_Init(&argc, &argv);

    // Get the rank of this process
    MPI_Comm_rank(MPI_COMM_WORLD, &rank);

    // Get the total number of processes
    MPI_Comm_size(MPI_COMM_WORLD, &size);

